WEB-SOURCE PARITY (features/system/components/status/FrontendErrorsCard.tsx)
  Data: useWebErrorsSummary -> GET /admin/web-errors/summary (generated op get_api_v1_admin_web_errors_summary).
  Reproduced regions: Bug-glyph header + title; rolling-hour total + descriptive caption; top-offenders list
  (neutral name badge + route + count) with the web entry.name/route || em-dash gates and fmtInt count grouping;
  the top.length === 0 -> "No frontend errors reported in the last hour." copy.
  States (mandated superset; every one renders - no hidden surfaces):
    loading -> skeleton chrome (web two Skeleton h-6 bars)
    loaded  -> total + offenders list OR no-errors copy (web data branch)
    empty   -> "Unable to load error summary." friendly surface (web !data)
    error   -> QueryError equivalent + retry affordance (web !data; native adds the mandated retry)
    stale   -> cached content + data-freshness chip (stale age)
    offline -> cached content + offline badge + data-freshness chip

ARCHITECTURE / CONVENTIONS
  - Subdirectory 4-file surface: feature-views/FrontendErrorsCard/{*.Model,*.Source,*.ViewModel,*}.cs
    (matches the AcDcStatsPanel subdirectory convention; the commit path is the directory).
  - Data flows via the shared P1/S8 state-holder seam (IFrontendErrorsSource -> CacheThenNetworkEngine);
    the view performs NO HTTP.
  - i18n: every region resolves through the i18n facade; the P1/S10 catalog ALREADY carries the matching keys
