  - Tokens (P1/S9) via DisplayTokens + typography components; no Tailwind, no raw chart/map/library imports.
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): view.opened slug=FrontendErrorsCard emitted once on Loaded; PII-safe (slug only).
  - Accessibility: Narrator names on the surface, header, total block, each offender row and the offline badge;
